olf division on his back; Nike golf sales peaked at $792 million in 2013","src":"Athlon Sports","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiggFBVV95cUxQVldQQktQNlc4aThtenk2X3RISzNaT2hMVGdJSm5NUmtjZHc5UFZQZHhCbXJDMGxiMXZiQURucU5QTURha3pZLV8tbmVKRkY2Z3p0VUJQdnJFMUxBclIyN0FOSV9iVkVQWUVzeHBtR0daQ0tCLWdyeVREaHVyTVBkaDRB?oc=5","date":"2026-10-28","zh":"1996年，耐吉以4000萬美元的價格簽下了20歲的泰格·伍茲，並在他的支持下建立了一個高爾夫部門； 2013年耐吉高爾夫銷售額達到峰值7.92億美元"},{"title":"Union x Nike Dunk Low 'Natural Selection' Release Info","src":"Complex","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxOWWl2VkxyNUdDZlJUcmFJM25pYTBmZ1ZzQmN5c01QVTM1LWZwakZMaVpyX0E1X3ZKUGpUQjE4MU55MzJmalFsWEJaNzlSVGZUTmdoeVh5R2pqYWRuaFNZNHA2dDdSVVcyZTNtQlRmZ2gzN1hoa3I3UVZiZ1g1cWN0dlh1ckJvWFZyT1FCSlhJOG9jTFJzWXVHTnRpSWJDTEhITk9qZktwaDRUbHVsRGRFdWlB?oc=5","date":"2026-10-28","zh":"Union x Nike Dunk Low “Natural Selection” 發佈訊息"}],"themes":[{"name":"訂單/合約","count":4},{"name":"關稅/貿易","count":2},{"name":"分析師評等","count":2}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-07-15","period":"2026-05-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/320187/000032018726000088/nke-20260531.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"NIKE, Inc. was incorporated in 1967 under the laws of the State of Oregon. As used in this Annual Report on Form 10-K (this \"Annual Report\"), the terms \"we,\" \"us,\" \"our,\" \"NIKE\" and the \"Company\" refer to NIKE, Inc. and its predecessors, subsidiaries and affiliates, collectively, unless the context indicates otherwise.","zh":null},{"en":"Our principal business activity is the design, development and worldwide marketing and selling of athletic footwear, apparel, equipment, accessories and services. NIKE is the largest seller of athletic footwear and apparel in the world. We sell our products through NIKE Direct operations, which are comprised of both NIKE-owned retail stores and sales through our digital platforms (also referred to as \"NIKE Brand Digital\") and to wholesale accounts, which include a mix of independent distributors, licensees and sales representatives in nearly all countries around the world. We also offer interactive consumer services and experiences. Nearly all of our products are manufactured by independent contractors. Nearly all footwear, apparel and equipment products are manufactured outside the United States.","zh":null},{"en":"All references to fiscal 2026, 2025 and 2024 are to NIKE, Inc.'s fiscal years ended May 31, 2026, 2025 and 2024, respectively. Any references to other fiscal years refer to a fiscal year ending on May 31 of that year.","zh":null}],"markets":[{"en":"We offer our products under the NIKE, Jordan and Converse brands. Our strategy is to achieve sustainable, profitable long-term growth by leading with sport, creating innovative, \"must-have\" products, building deep personal consumer connections with our brands and delivering compelling consumer experiences through digital platforms and at retail. We believe this approach will allow us to create products that better meet individual consumer needs while accelerating our largest growth opportunities.","zh":null},{"en":"NIKE's athletic footwear products are designed primarily for specific athletic use, although a large percentage of the products are worn for casual or leisure purposes. We place considerable emphasis on innovation and high-quality construction in the development and manufacturing of our products.","zh":null}],"customers":[{"en":"We experience moderate fluctuations in aggregate sales volume during the year. The mix of product sales may vary considerably as a result of changes in seasonal and geographic demand for particular types of footwear, apparel and equipment, as well as other macroeconomic, strategic, operating and logistics-related factors.","zh":null},{"en":"Because NIKE is a consumer products company, the relative popularity and availability of various sports and fitness activities, as well as changing design trends and consumer preferences, affect the demand for our products. We must, therefore, respond to trends and shifts in consumer preferences by adjusting the mix of existing product offerings and channels, developing new products, styles and categories and influencing sports and fitness preferences through extensive marketing. Failure to respond in a timely and adequate manner could have a material adverse effect on our sales and profitability. This is a continuing risk. Refer to","zh":null}],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2026-05-31","items":[{"name":"NIKE Brand","val":45222000000,"zh":"NIKE Brand"},{"name":"Converse","val":1174000000,"zh":"Converse"}],"total":46398000000},"prod":{"end":"2026-05-31","items":[{"name":"Footwear","val":30538000000,"zh":"Footwear"},{"name":"Apparel","val":13497000000,"zh":"Apparel"},{"name":"Sporting Equipment","val":2220000000,"zh":"Sporting Equipment"},{"name":"Product & Service Other","val":143000000,"zh":"Product & Service Other"}],"total":46398000000}},"peers":["SBUX","V","DIS","WMT","COST"]}}